diagnostics/project-bad-directory-and-malformed/2bad/helper.em:1:1: the directory `2bad` cannot be a namespace
  var helper = 2
  ^
A directory name becomes a namespace, so it has to read as one: letters, digits and `_`, starting with a letter. Rename it, as in `shapes/`.
diagnostics/project-bad-directory-and-malformed/main.em:1:10: expected a parameter name, found a whole number
  func bad(1,
           ^
A parameter is a name and a type, as in `count: Int`.
